ilestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2021-09-06T12:56:58Z","updated_at":"2021-09-27T22:31:21Z","closed_at":"2021-09-27T22:31:21Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Describe the bug\r\n\r\nThere's a bug with hot-reload and https://quarkus.io/guides/kafka#serialization-autodetection \r\n\r\n```java\r\npublic class OrderSerializer extends ObjectMapperSerializer<Order> {\r\n    public OrderSerializer() {\r\n        super();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### How to Reproduce?\r\n\r\n- git clone https://github.com/FroMage/devoxx-fr-2021-quarkus-cheese-shop\r\n- cd devoxx-fr-2021-quarkus-cheese-shop\r\n- Edit the `OrderSerializer.java` file to the incorrect:\r\n```java\r\n// Incorrectly a Deserialiser as pasted from the guide\r\npublic class OrderSerializer extends ObjectMapperDeserializer<Order> {\r\n    public OrderSerializer() {\r\n        super(Order.class);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n- quarkus dev\r\n- Go to http://localhost:8080/order\r\n- It fails, fine\r\n- Edit the `OrderSerializer.java` file to fix it:\r\n```java\r\npublic class OrderSerializer extends ObjectMapperSerializer<Order> {\r\n    public OrderSerializer() {\r\n        super();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n- Go to http://localhost:8080/order\r\n- Should work, but doesn't\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"stuartwdouglas","id":328571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODU3MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/328571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartwdouglas","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartwdouglas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartwdouglas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartwdouglas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartwdouglas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github